OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain possible across Belfast and the
OL,7,Feast, the rain soon moving into the
OL,8,FIrish Sea. Clear spells developing and
OL,9,Fwinds mainly light and rather chilly
OL,10,Fby dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells, but cloud building with a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers. Drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter again later.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,18,Fspells and occasional heavy showers on
OL,19,FFriday. The showers lighter and well
OL,20,Fscattered on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,21,Fmore in the way of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
